setvar intF[1112] = 0
bgload SFWEC00.jpg 60
delay 8
setimg SFWEC25.png 148 172
delay 229
bgload SIRO.jpg 47
music BGM26B.mp3
text This world really had come to an end.
text No new life will be born here.
text I understand that well now.
text There's no life within those animals. They're simply "things" that have taken the form of living creatures.
text The only thing here with life is her.
text But if that really is the case... Then what about me?
text I have a will, of course; I'm not like them in that regard, I guess.
text I love her. I want to be with her forever.
text No matter where she walks, I'll follow her.
text Even if she hates me, I'll follow her.
text That's my will, and those are my emotions.
text It's proof that I'm me.
text But then, where could I have come from?
text Where did this "will" of mine come from?
text I search my memories.
text I come across one from before I was born.
text It's there at the bottom of my sluggish consciousness.
text Either long ago or in the distant future, I'm not really sure... Regardless, I'm there.
text In a place that makes my heart feel warm.
text ..."Was it better than here?"
text ..."Did you like it there?"
text ..."Was it less lonely than this place?"
text Yes...
text It was a place full of fun, a place where I wasn't lonely.
text I was there.
text If only I didn't have this body... Would I have been able to go back there?
text But now I have a body that ties my consciousness down.
text A body that she made for me.
text I'm living here at the end of this world.
text While I don't know how that happened...
text I'm fine with it.
text Because at least she's not alone anymore.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG306"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s30
fi
goto 31
label s30
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 31
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text We put the unmoving junk-doll in the ground.
text It's a burial of sorts.
text The girl is quiet the whole time.
text When our work is over, I grab her hand and pull it.
text ..."Hm?"
text She looks down at me.
text I put my hand into hers.
text ..."You want to make a new one?"
text I nod.
text ..."But it won't move."
text ..."We can't make... a new friend."
text She says it with a melancholic voice.
text I shake my head.
text ..."You want to make something else?"
text Nod.
text ..."What?"
text I stand there, completely motionless.
text I don't know either, to be honest.
text I just feel as though that's what needs to happen.
text She's able to take a bunch of junk and make something out of it.
text That's something I can't do.
text It's something special that only she can.
text In that case, I'm sure it must mean something.
text I turn around.
text Even the cabin that the two of us live in was built by her, wasn't it?
text ..."I can't make something that big."
text That's what she tells me, anyhow.
text ..."But maybe, with enough time, I could."
text I nod my head.
text ..."What should we do, then?"
text I begin to hop up and down in the air.
text I want something that will make me this excited.
text She can make it, and I'll help.
text It seems like it'll be so much fun.
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s31
fi
goto 32
label s31
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 32
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
setvar intF[1112] = 1
if rtf1 != ""
	jump $rtf1 $rtl1
fi
jump $rtf0 $rtl0
jump SEEN6900_7_0.scr
